# France Travail API credentials.
#
# Get them free:
#   1. Create an account at https://francetravail.io
#   2. Create an application in your dashboard
#   3. Subscribe that application to "Offres d'emploi v2"
#   4. Copy the client ID and secret key below
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (same directory) and fill in the values.
# `.env` is gitignored — never commit real credentials.

FRANCETRAVAIL_CLIENT_ID=
FRANCETRAVAIL_CLIENT_SECRET=

# Optional. Only set this if francetravail.io shows a different scope for your
# application. Default: "api_offresdemploiv2 o2dsoffre"
# FRANCETRAVAIL_SCOPE=
